            "review_title": "Review at Oc Linh",
            "review_text": "Derek O\nPuerto Vallarta, Mexico4 contributions\n0\nFalse pricing\nJan 2023 • Friends\nThe display pricing on their menu is not what they charge. We were charged almost 12 per oyster and clam. They told us they charge by ounce. Really shady business practice. You can get way better seafood at a much better price on Vinh Khanh street. Overall tho the food was 7/10. I hope they fix their pricing or at least display how they charge on their menu\nRead more\nWritten January 25, 2023",
            "rating": 5.0,
