            "review_title": "Review at Oc Linh",
            "review_text": "YSKing\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam269 contributions\n4\nNo.1 seafood restaurant in hcm!!\nJan 2019 • Friends\nIt is a seafood restaurant located in district 7.\nYou can have fresh seafood which owner chooses by himself to cook on the spot.\nIt is a very lively and clean restaurant. I recommend this restaurant to people who would like to eat local seafood food in good situation. It is recommended for those who are uneasy about hygiene if it is a restaurant that sits on the street and eats.\nIf you want to eat seafood in Ho Chi Minh City, you should go.\nRead more\nWritten January 9, 2019",
