            "review_title": "Review at Oc Linh",
            "review_text": "needlehill\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam454 contributions\n1\nMessy, overcrowded, too noisy\nApr 2018 • Couples\nAs often in Vietnam, this recent popular large seafood restaurant is over-everything: they put the mess in the street, they put horrible music way too loud (but noise is a religion here...), etc.\nFor comparable food and prices, prefer the other seafood restaurant next door, Hải Sản Biển Nhớ, much more quiet. It's even worth the journey from D1.\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten May 14, 2018",
