            "review_title": "Review at Oc Linh",
            "review_text": "Shi\n163 contributions\n1\nDelicious seafood, price above average\nJan 2018 • Couples\nVisited Oc Linh for the second time having really enjoyed the food and the service during our first visit. The food lived up to expectations, the fish was very fresh, particularly enjoyed the steamed crab and fried tiger prawns.\nBy the way they do have menus in English, even if you maybe informed otherwise.\nCertainly recommend if you are after good seafood, the price is a bit steep even for district 7. Giving this a 4 because the quality of service we experienced from one of the more senior staff members (appeared to be senior and was ordering people about). The lady who looked after our table did an excellent job, on both visits.\nRead more\nWritten January 27, 2018",
